WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.351
Sammy was a cute sparrow.

2
00:00:13.952 --> 00:00:15.974
He flew over the river with his mom.

3
00:00:20.437 --> 00:00:23.199
Mom, it's cloudy today," Sammy said.

4
00:00:23.219 --> 00:00:26.561
"Yes, Sammy," said Mom.

5
00:00:26.581 --> 00:00:30.624
"It looks like it will rain soon."

6
00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:35.722
"Mom, I'm hungry," Sammy complained.

7
00:00:35.742 --> 00:00:38.584
"Yes, I'm also hungry.

8
00:00:39.645 --> 00:00:41.026
Let's find something to eat."

9
00:00:41.046 --> 00:00:43.708
"Mom, Mom!"

10
00:00:43.988 --> 00:00:44.569
Sammy said.

11
00:00:44.589 --> 00:00:46.590
"Rest in the woods.

12
00:00:47.331 --> 00:00:48.552
I will go and get some food."

13
00:00:48.572 --> 00:00:51.694
"Can you do it by yourself?"

14
00:00:52.114 --> 00:00:52.755
Mom asked.

15
00:00:54.096 --> 00:00:54.756
"Sure, I can!"

16
00:00:56.658 --> 00:00:59.220
Sammy was old enough to find food on his own.

17
00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:03.701
He was a good flier too.

18
00:01:05.401 --> 00:01:08.002
He flew around the river to look for insects.

19
00:01:09.362 --> 00:01:11.123
But he couldn't find a single one.

20
00:01:11.143 --> 00:01:14.364
"Hmm, this is strange.

21
00:01:15.204 --> 00:01:16.945
Why can't I find any insects?"

22
00:01:17.305 --> 00:01:17.925
he wondered.

23
00:01:19.745 --> 00:01:22.626
Sammy felt tired and went back to his mom.

24
00:01:22.646 --> 00:01:27.708
"Mom, I searched hard, but I couldn't find a single insect.

25
00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:32.203
I used to see insects everywhere, but now they are gone."

26
00:01:33.624 --> 00:01:36.166
"Sammy, why don't you fly low?"

27
00:01:36.626 --> 00:01:37.487
Mom suggested.

28
00:01:37.507 --> 00:01:41.030
"What? You want me to fly low?"

29
00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:42.211
Sammy asked.

30
00:01:42.231 --> 00:01:44.693
"Yes, fly low.

31
00:01:46.014 --> 00:01:47.755
Then you will see the insects."

32
00:01:49.957 --> 00:01:51.758
Sammy took his mom's advice.

33
00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:55.742
He flew around the river again.

34
00:01:56.742 --> 00:01:58.484
This time he flew low.

35
00:02:00.072 --> 00:02:04.233
"Wow! I couldn't find a single one when I flew high," he said.

36
00:02:04.253 --> 00:02:07.754
"Now I can see many insects.

37
00:02:08.014 --> 00:02:15.196
Yay!" Sammy caught a big insect and brought it to his mom.

38
00:02:20.278 --> 00:02:21.238
I don't understand.

39
00:02:22.719 --> 00:02:24.979
Why are all the insects so close to the ground?"

40
00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:27.180
His mother explained.

41
00:02:28.389 --> 00:02:31.350
"Before it rains, the air gets moist.

42
00:02:32.391 --> 00:02:35.492
The moisture in the air makes insects' wings heavy.

43
00:02:37.053 --> 00:02:40.575
So the insects fly in the grass and bushes near the ground."

44
00:02:42.356 --> 00:02:43.637
Sammy understood.

45
00:02:43.657 --> 00:02:45.498
"I get it!

46
00:02:46.138 --> 00:02:49.840
So when it looks like it will rain, I should fly low to look for insects."

47
00:02:51.081 --> 00:02:52.442
"Right!" said Mom.

48
00:02:54.263 --> 00:02:56.344
Just then it started to rain.

49
00:02:57.911 --> 00:03:01.183
Sammy and his mom watched the raindrops and smiled.
